A command whose broken holds a type error and carries a suppression record naming a
code no kind holds. The record can match nothing whatever the type error hides, so it
is stale although the type error skips broken.

-- go.mod --
module example.com/app

go 1.27
-- deadset.json --
{"target": {"kind": "application"}}
-- main.go --
package main

func main() {}

//deadset:ignore DS1999 -- kept for the loader
func broken() int { return undefinedName }
